# Create a plan

Read the `create-plan` skill. Do not reprint it here.

## House stops

- Cursor: **CreatePlan** (`name`, `overview`, `plan`, todos) plus
  `docs/plans/YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>.md`. Never claim done from Write-only markdown.
- No TBD / stub / deferred-inside-scope. Out of scope is allowed.
- Repo first, then cited external research. ≥2 real alternatives per fork.
- Do not implement unless the user clicks **Build** or explicitly asks.
- Edits unstaged. No commit/push/PR unless asked.

Slash: `/plan`. After drafting, prefer `/review-plan` before **Build**.
